<title>USA: General Mills Inc Q1 May 25 net down.</title>
<headline>General Mills Inc Q1 May 25 net down.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.42		    $0.49</p>
<p> Net			 68,200		   77,500</p>
<p> Revs		   1,444,000		1,382,100</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 160,700		  159,200</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 1997 results include loss from joint ventures of $1.5 million vs loss $200,000 a year ago. Q4 1997 total costs and expenses were $1.34 billion vs $1.26 billion.  </p>
<p>			YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.82		    $3.00</p>
<p> Net			445,400		  476,400</p>
<p> Revs		   5,609,300		5,416,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 158,200		  158,900</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: FY97 results include non-cash, after-tax charge for accounting for impairment of long-lived assets of $0.18 a share. Excluding charge, FY97 earnings were $3.00 a share.</p>
<p>FY97 loss from joint ventures $6.3 million vs loss $2.8 million a year ago.</p>
<p>FY97 total costs and expenses $4.90 billion vs $4.66 billion.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
